# CES-009 – create an enrolment
# Variant B: one question per page

Start /enrolments
Scope /enrolments /enrol
Exclude /prototype /prototype-admin /assets
Tags enrolment CES-009

--- Setup ---

Use setup.clinician
Goto /prototype/set?variant=b&next=/enrol/start

--- Map ---

Snapshot
Fill "#nhsNumber" "999 123 4853"
ClickButton "Continue"
WaitForUrl /enrol/confirm-patient
Snapshot
Choose "Yes"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Fill "#clinicianId" "Asha"
Wait 500
Click "#clinicianId__option--0"
Wait 1200
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "DTx product A"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "Insomnia"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "Indication A1"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "Pathway 1"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickButton "Create enrolment"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
